---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout title="404 - 页面未找到">
  <div class="py-24 text-center space-y-4 max-w-md mx-auto">
    <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-[var(--accent-softer)] text-[var(--accent)] font-bold text-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto shadow-xs">
      404
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)]">
      页面未找到
    </h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
      抱歉，您访问的文章或页面可能已被移动、下架或不存在。
    </p>
    <div class="pt-4">
      <a
        href="/"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[var(--accent)] text-white text-xs font-semibold hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity shadow-xs"
      >
        返回首页
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
